# LOOP LEDGER

Workspace: {{PROJECT_NAME}}

Append only, never rewrite history. One line per closed task, one line per call fired, one block per weekly review. If the run log and the ledger disagree, the run log is the record and this file is the summary that got it wrong.

## Run logs

One file per task: `_log/LOOP-RUNLOG-<task>.md`. Append only, one line per event, timestamped:

```
| Time | Loop | Event | Detail |
```

Loop is which part of the graph wrote the line: run, workaround, hunt, review, tier check, call, rollback. At close the run log compresses into one task line below. Tasks below the small task floor skip the run log; their ledger line is the whole record.

